<title>USA: Zale Corp names Gove senior vice president.</title>
<headline>Zale Corp names Gove senior vice president.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zale Corp said Monday it named Sue Gove as senior vice president and treasurer.</p>
<p>Gove previously served as senior vice president of corporate planning and analysis. She replaces vice president Mike Kearney, whose position was elevated into a senior post, company spokeswoman Laura Moore said.</p>
<p>In her new capacity Gove will oversee investor relations and the treasury, tax and control functions.</p>
</text>
